{"lyrics":"[00:00.12]Man, what? Haha\n[00:03.18]This shit funny, one second\n[00:07.20]Oof, this Hennessy strong as fuck, boy\n[00:11.06]She told me put my heart in the bag (In the bag) and nobody gets hurt (Don't hurt me, love)\n[00:17.14]Now I'm running from her love, I'm not fast (Fast) so I'm making it worse (I'm making it worse)\n[00:22.82]Now I'm digging up a grave for my past, I'm a whole different person (I'm a whole different person)\n[00:29.74]It's a gift and a curse (It's a gift and a curse) but I cannot reverse it\n[00:34.70]I can't reverse it\n[00:39.96]It was a gift and a curse and now I'm drinkin' too much, so I'ma talk with a slur\n[00:44.42]Last time I saw you, it ended in a blur\n[00:49.34]I woke up in a hearse, you said you loved me first (First)\n[00:54.44]One thing my dad told me was \"Never let your woman know when you're insecure\"\n[01:00.72]So I put Gucci on the fur and I put my wrist on iceberg (Iceberg)\n[01:06.50]One thing my heart tells me is \"Flex on a ho every time they're insecure\" (Every time they're insecure)\n[01:11.70]I can't see it through, I'm running from you, Is your love for real?\n[01:19.96]Is your love really true?\n[01:23.06]She told me put my heart in the bag (In the bag) and nobody gets hurt (Don't hurt me, love)\n[01:28.86]Now I'm running from her love, I'm not fast (Fast) so I'm making it worse (I'm making it worse)\n[01:34.84]Now I'm digging up a grave for my past, I'm a whole different person (I'm a whole different person)\n[01:41.88]It's a gift and a curse (It's a gift and a curse) but I cannot reverse it\n[01:45.96]You gave me the runaround, I really hate the runaround\n[01:50.08]You really got me paranoid, I always keep a gun around\n[01:53.06]You always give me butterflies when you come around\n[01:56.62]When you come around, when you come around\n[01:59.32]You let me know love is not the answer, not the answer, not the answer\n[02:05.84]I love to do drugs, so mind my manners, I get high when you don't decide to answer\n[02:11.96]Phone home (Home), I need to phone home (Home)\n[02:16.90]I'm throwing rocks at your window, I need to go home (Go home)\n[02:43.06]I don't wanna leave, I just wanna be with you, you, you, you (You, you, you, oh)\n[03:05.06]She told me put my heart in the bag (In the bag) and nobody gets hurt (Don't hurt me, love)\n[03:18.94]Now I'm running from her love, I'm not fast (Fast) so I'm making it worse (I'm making it worse)\n[03:29.80]Now I'm digging up a grave for my past, I'm a whole different person (I'm a whole different person)\n[03:51.26]It's a gift and a curse (It's a gift and a curse) but I cannot reverse it","words":[[0.12,0.26,"Man,"],[1.02,1.14,"what?"],[1.22,3.14,"Haha"],[3.18,3.3,"This"],[3.42,3.6,"shit"],[3.74,4.04,"funny,"],[6.46,6.52,"one"],[6.56,7.12,"second"],[7.2,7.3,"Oof,"],[7.34,7.5,"this"],[7.66,8.0,"Hennessy"],[8.08,8.36,"strong"],[8.42,8.48,"as"],[8.56,8.76,"fuck,"],[8.84,8.98,"boy"],[11.06,11.12,"She"],[11.24,11.44,"told"],[11.48,11.52,"me"],[11.6,11.72,"put"],[11.78,11.96,"my"],[12.02,12.46,"heart"],[13.18,13.28,"in"],[13.32,13.38,"the"],[13.5,14.08,"bag"],[14.14,14.16,"(In"],[14.36,14.4,"the"],[14.64,14.72,"bag)"],[14.76,14.8,"and"],[14.84,15.46,"nobody"],[15.74,16.06,"gets"],[16.12,16.42,"hurt"],[16.48,16.56,"(Don't"],[16.6,16.68,"hurt"],[16.76,16.82,"me,"],[16.86,17.06,"love)"],[17.14,17.18,"Now"],[17.22,17.28,"I'm"],[17.32,17.52,"running"],[17.58,17.82,"from"],[17.86,17.9,"her"],[17.96,18.44,"love,"],[18.96,19.04,"I'm"],[19.12,19.24,"not"],[19.28,19.36,"fast"],[19.44,20.12,"(Fast)"],[20.6,20.66,"so"],[20.74,20.92,"I'm"],[20.98,21.34,"making"],[21.44,21.46,"it"],[21.56,21.64,"worse"],[21.7,21.74,"(I'm"],[21.82,21.96,"making"],[22.0,22.02,"it"],[22.06,22.56,"worse)"],[22.82,23.02,"Now"],[23.06,23.12,"I'm"],[23.22,23.58,"digging"],[23.68,23.78,"up"],[23.84,23.84,"a"],[23.94,24.7,"grave"],[25.08,25.18,"for"],[25.26,25.38,"my"],[25.46,26.24,"past,"],[26.66,26.78,"I'm"],[26.92,26.92,"a"],[27.08,27.28,"whole"],[27.36,27.98,"diff